# Polaris — .dockerignore
#
# The build context is the repository root for the application and database
# images, and polaris_web/ for the edge and the pooler. Everything the images
# COPY is listed in the Dockerfiles; everything else is weight on every build,
# and some of it must never reach a build daemon at all.
#
# Added at v9.225: there was no .dockerignore, so every image build shipped the
# git history, the site captures, the report PDF and any locally generated
# secrets to the daemon.

# ============================================================================
# Never: secret material
# ============================================================================
polaris_web/secrets/
polaris_web/secrets.sealed/
polaris_web/secrets.sealed.prev/
polaris.env
.env
.env.*
secrets.json
credentials.json

# ============================================================================
# Version control and CI metadata
# ============================================================================
.git/
.github/
.gitignore
.dockerignore
.pre-commit-config.yaml

# ============================================================================
# Build and test artifacts
# ============================================================================
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.hypothesis/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
polaris_zk/target/
**/*.rs.bk
venv/
.venv/
env/

# ============================================================================
# Documentation, the published page and the report
# None of it is copied into any image.
# ============================================================================
docs/
DEVNOTES/
meta/
site/
*.md
LICENSE
NOTICE
CITATION.cff

# ============================================================================
# Test suites and local tooling
# The images run the application, not its tests.
# ============================================================================
**/test_*.py
polaris_checks/
scripts/
# Lab record 017 (gate row OP-18): the one script an image runs, the migration runner the postgres
# image carries for the Kubernetes upgrade Job.
!scripts/polaris-migrate.sh
deploy/
polaris_cli/
polaris_zk/witness2/
polaris_web/venv/
polaris_web/docker-state/
polaris_web/.docker-volume/
polaris-state/
state/
.playwright-mcp/
perf-baseline.json
.DS_Store
